# Graphify scan scope: product-id program surfaces only (matches AGENTS.md primary scope
# plus `web/` for product-id-ops). Repo root is still the scan root so `graphify-out/`
# stays at the monorepo root and Cursor rules keep working.
#
# When this file exists, Graphify loads it instead of falling back to `.gitignore` for
# the repo root — keep common noise patterns below in sync with what we still want excluded.

# --- Allow only these top-level trees ---
/*
!services/
!web/

services/*
!services/ocr/
!services/places-proxy/
!services/product-id/

# --- Noise / generated (always exclude) ---
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.turbo/
.next/
.nuxt/
dist/
build/
out/
coverage/
.nyc_output/
*.tsbuildinfo
.git/
graphify-out/
.husky/_/

# --- Secrets / local env ---
.env
.env.*

# HTML graph viz defaults to 5000 nodes; this repo’s scoped graph is larger.
# Regenerate graph.html + GRAPH_REPORT.md:
#   GRAPHIFY_VIZ_NODE_LIMIT=12000 graphify cluster-only . --no-label
